# Your work goes here.
#
# This directory is intentionally empty. The workbook (../README.md) has YOU
# write the kernels as exercises:
#   - sgemm.cu   (modules 02-06: naive -> tiled -> 1D -> 2D -> vectorized)
#   - bench.cu   (module 07: head-to-head vs cuBLAS)
#
# Build, e.g.:
#   nvcc -O3 -arch=native learning/kernels/sgemm.cu -o bin/sgemm && ./bin/sgemm
#   nvcc -O3 -arch=native --ptxas-options=-v learning/kernels/sgemm.cu -o bin/sgemm
#   nvcc -O3 -arch=native learning/kernels/bench.cu -o bin/bench -lcublas && ./bin/bench
